{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さん、こんにちは。株式会社さくらさくらプラス代表の中山", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670693.3541455}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "です。本日は2026年7月期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670698.0300753}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第三四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670701.2048445}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は二千二十六年七月期第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670704.3004625}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高については百三十六", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670708.4796004}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "億七千九百万となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670713.248875}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。これは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670716.2958348}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670720.4310718}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670724.763788}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670728.4491396}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670733.4312518}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670737.4189854}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は実施したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670740.415804}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては厳守となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670741.1061466}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どおり進捗しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670746.1332314}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は10億6千百万円となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670750.5423045}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一点五パーセントの原因となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670752.559463}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670757.6347957}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670761.6300893}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に向上しまた", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670762.9311576}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。経常利益は11億2800万円と", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670768.0772836}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "なり、前年同期比9。5の増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670770.6256735}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670775.1970208}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらに伴う開演前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより同益となり", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670778.226353}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ます。親会社株主に属する当期純利", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670782.2304919}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前年度", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670785.377227}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "前期に計上した不採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなった", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670793.3743718}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、早期は増益となります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670795.9324284}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670799.2336907}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "売上高は通期予算に対して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670801.844961}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "各サービスも堅調に成長しており、当四半期累計機関におて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670810.1163352}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "て順調に推移しております。営業利益は通期予算に対し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670814.5408924}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応のない成果や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670819.441344}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の定理といった毎期継続している費用削減の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670823.5843754}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "比較が確実に低下を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670825.4940917}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670828.8476892}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "これらの施策が利益の上振れをけん引し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670832.2178848}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "四半期累計期間において通期予算を前倒して", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670837.2322192}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "達成しました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670838.8215113}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて貸借対照表です", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670842.3311367}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産の分は販売に伴う販売用不動産の減少があった", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670846.982928}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一補助金収入による未収入金の増加", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670851.8518367}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不動産取得、保育施設の新設、増証による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670854.5821826}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産合計は二十八億", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670859.5366955}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "億7100万円増加しました支えのぶは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670863.8468626}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670863.9780948}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "蔵書に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670866.0430946}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "禁忌不動産", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670868.136669}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "負債合計は二十一億三千三百万円。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670875.7587452}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "らの結果、自己資本比率は四十三", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670880.6038582}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。9から40。7に低下いたしました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670884.0871477}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて二千二十六年七月期軽トピックスをお知らせいたし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670887.9478545}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。保育サービスにおいては大阪市中国で桜咲く未来東平を", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670892.8943472}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "予定通り解説しており", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670894.0820704}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "桜咲く未来晴海におても予定通り増床を行い", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670898.4410288}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "定員数が増加しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670900.5917783}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足しいる晴海エリアから月島エリア", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670905.5714374}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670909.9972165}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "2027年7月期では", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670914.721975}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "東京都中国にて一施設の新規保育所の開設を予定しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670917.6631882}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "フェムケア、フェムテックサービスにおいては、連結子会社のイェールにて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670922.9106584}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "2026年夏頃に新製品の発売を予定しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670928.3425565}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "新製品の発売により量産サプリメント市場で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670932.4464293}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "さらなるケアの拡大", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670933.48827}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて覚悟会社の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670938.0337722}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "取締役の就任についてお知らせいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670939.6889446}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "連結子会社の桜咲く未来で石川祐介氏が取締役へ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670945.2594826}
