{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "石川氏の就任により佐久良佐久未来およびグループ全体の財務戦略および", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670955.5938115}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ガバナンス体制をより強固に補強向上させるための", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670960.6472833}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.25-20260710-170441-d1c59b1e", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "経営管理体制の刷新をいたしました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783670963.5317}
